#: src/window.js:668
msgid ""
"Animates behind terminal text with a dark tint. Requires Kitty 0.49 or newer "
"with its shader compiler. Kitty controls animation timing and window size. "
"Images are optimized to 128 pixels and 256 colors. First use can take a "
"moment to compile."
msgstr ""
"在终端文字后播放带深色调的动画。需要 Kitty 0.49 或更新版本及其着色器编译器。"
"Kitty 控制动画时序和窗口大小。图像会优化为 128 像素和 256 色。首次使用时编译"
"可能需要片刻。"

#: src/window.js:671
msgid ""
"Uses the current frame as a tinted Kitty background. Your desktop is "
"unchanged."
msgstr "将当前帧用作带色调的 Kitty 背景。不更改桌面。"

#: src/window.js:675
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Animates on every display and sets its first frame as the still background. "
"GNOME 50 or 51 on Wayland is required."
msgstr ""
"在每个显示器上播放动画，并将首帧设为静态背景。需要 Wayland 上的 GNOME 50。"

